PR #77 — feat(fulfillment): stock reservations, product edits, delivery ETA, carrier events

Description (from PR body):
  - POST /v1/reservations reserves stock for a cart during checkout (15 min hold).
  - PUT /v1/products/:id lets merchandisers edit price and title from the admin app.
  - Order responses now include `estimatedDelivery`, from the new `carrier_eta` column
    (migration included). Storefront and the partner feed both read GET /v1/orders/:id.
  - New consumer applies carrier webhooks (`shipment.in_transit`, `shipment.delivered`,
    `shipment.returned`) relayed through our events bus to order status.
  Tests added for the happy path of each.

